cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these data or figures, please cite both the paper and this
  data artifact.
title: "AutoFL: Experimental Results and Figures"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Chiu
    given-names: Yen-Jung
    affiliation: "Department of Biomedical Engineering, Chang Gung University, Taoyuan, Taiwan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2087-2266"
abstract: >-
  Raw experimental outputs (CSV and JSON) and publication figures (PDF and
  PNG) of the AutoFL paper: primary benchmark across 5 strategies and 4
  frameworks; non-DL extension; cross-provider validation (Claude, Gemini
  2.5 Flash, Llama 3 8B); FL convergence traces; non-IID partition results
  with centralized baseline; hardware sweep; exemplar-correction runs.
  v2.0 adds the corrected reruns and the resubmission experiments
  (template baseline, self-repair, prompt ablation, repeated sampling,
  frozen expansion benchmark, differential tests) and keeps the v1.0 files
  unchanged.
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - benchmark data
  - FedAvg
  - non-IID
  - prompt engineering
